diff --git a/axum/CHANGELOG.md b/axum/CHANGELOG.md
index 310dbf21..db0b1bc7 100644
--- a/axum/CHANGELOG.md
+++ b/axum/CHANGELOG.md
@@ -11,9 +11,14 @@ and this project adheres to [Semantic Versioning](https://semver.org/spec/v2.0.0
   Use `axum::middleware::from_extractor` instead ([#1077])
 - **breaking:** Allow `Error: Into<Infallible>` for `Route::{layer, route_layer}` ([#924])
 - **breaking:** `MethodRouter` now panics on overlapping routes ([#1102])
+- **breaking:** Remove trailing slash redirects. Requests to a path with a
+  different trailing slash than the route now go to the fallback instead of
+  being redirected. If you want to support both `/foo` and `/foo/` add both
+  routes ([#1119])
 
 [#1077]: https://github.com/tokio-rs/axum/pull/1077
 [#1102]: https://github.com/tokio-rs/axum/pull/1102
+[#1119]: https://github.com/tokio-rs/axum/pull/1119
 [#924]: https://github.com/tokio-rs/axum/pull/924
 
